  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd a first-class `MCPClient` for Browser Use 1.0. It connects to MCP servers over stdio, discovers tools, and registers them as `Tools` actions. The generated argument models preserve explicit `null` values allowed by nested JSON Schemas while omitting absent optional fields and retaining schema defaults.\n\nThe implementation handles local `$ref` resolution and nullable type arrays, schema composition (`anyOf`/`oneOf`/`allOf`), JSON-aware enum/const/uniqueItems checks, and exact `multipleOf` validation. Adds real stdio integration and regression tests.\n\nRelated: #6288.",
